{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your flock for the most bird-brained battle in history! <strong>Chicken Chicken</strong> throws you and your friends into a post-apocalyptic world run by unhinged poultry, with one goal: total domination. This demo includes three modes:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>King of the Junkyard</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight gravity and each other clawing your way up a junkyard tower of chaos and suffering!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049150/extras/f111ec1bb83f0e9078435ce2dde3f5bb.poster.avif?t=1762972236\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049150/extras/f111ec1bb83f0e9078435ce2dde3f5bb.webm?t=1762972236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049150/extras/f111ec1bb83f0e9078435ce2dde3f5bb.mp4?t=1762972236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chicken Race</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive rickety, four-wheeled junkmobiles with dance-pad controls to deliver sacks of manure to the finish line!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049150/extras/cf008c6a78bf730bf35dcd441e11c7d9.poster.avif?t=1762972236\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049150/extras/cf008c6a78bf730bf35dcd441e11c7d9.webm?t=1762972236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049150/extras/cf008c6a78bf730bf35dcd441e11c7d9.mp4?t=1762972236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Swamp Chowdown</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tug a bloated chick through a toxic swamp to feed it flies, testing your teamwork and sanity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049150/extras/f981326408a18fea9934a8804cfa3669.poster.avif?t=1762972236\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049150/extras/f981326408a18fea9934a8804cfa3669.webm?t=1762972236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049150/extras/f981326408a18fea9934a8804cfa3669.mp4?t=1762972236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4049150?t=1762972236","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049150/8a0f8ba841e0a38d9a7546a6eabc049bb7751484/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762972236","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049150/712a803b69c434f764355b6b4ff24b06c19d52a0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762972236","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049150/712a803b69c434f764355b6b4ff24b06c19d52a0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762972236","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph